{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "一次一个界限", "content": "给孩子立界限时，一次只立一个界限，最多两个，不要一次立一大堆。这样孩子更容易遵守，避免因要求过多而感到 overwhelming 而放弃。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["界限", "数量", "执行"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00001", "b00002", "b00003", "b00004", "b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a003", "kind": "supports", "condition": null, "reason": "一次只立一个界限有助于孩子100%遵守，而一次立多个界限会导致每条遵守率低。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-19", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：设定界限数量时；均强调一次一个。", "reason": "补充一次只立一个界限，最多两个，避免 overwhelming。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-r-11", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：给孩子设定界限且希望可执行；legacy 附加“可视化可量化、后果、认可、合同”完整闭环，候选仅覆盖一次一个。", "reason": "对应五点中“一次一个”的要点。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "立界限不是立家规", "content": "立界限不同于立家规，不应像制定家规一样一次性列出大量规则要求孩子遵守。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["界限", "家规", "区别"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00002"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "一次一个界限的原则支持立界限不是立家规的观点", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": null, "reason": "立界限不同于立家规，因此不应一次立大量规则，而应一次只立一个界限。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-19", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：立界限与立家规区别时；均认为立界限不是立家规。", "reason": "补充不应像家规一样一次列大量规则。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-r-11", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：开始给孩子立界限阶段；legacy 说明完整界限体系转界限模块，候选未提。", "reason": "对应 legacy 限制“立界限不是立家规”。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "principle", "title": "100%遵守一条界限优于20%遵守五条界限", "content": "宁愿让孩子100%遵守一条界限，也好过给孩子五条界限但每条只能遵守20%。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["界限", "遵守", "效果"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "支持一次一个界限的原则", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-r-11", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：一次立一个界限，避免一次立太多；legacy 未单独说明优先度。", "reason": "补充集中遵守一条界限的优先原则。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "界限要详细、可视、可量化", "content": "立的界限必须非常详细、有可视性、可量化和可测评。例如，将“尊重我”具体化为“不大声跟我讲话、不翻白眼、我讲话时不走开、不摔门”等可观察行为；可测评指能清楚测量行为，如统计一周内摔门次数。如果界限太抽象，孩子觉得自己已尽力，父母觉得孩子不尽力，双方会在界限问题上产生阻隔。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["界限", "具体化", "可视化", "量化"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006", "b00007", "b00008", "b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a005", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "reason": "界限要详细、可视、可量化，这支持抽象概念需转化为孩子脑中能形成具体画面的行为描述。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a014", "kind": "supports", "condition": "合同内容要具体明确", "reason": "“界限要详细、可视、可量化”的要求支持“合同内容要具体明确”，即合同需写明具体尊重和不尊重行为。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 kind applies_to 改为 supports"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "抽象概念需转化为可视化行为", "content": "像“尊重”“爱”等抽象概念，必须转化为孩子脑中能形成具体画面的行为描述，例如“摔门”就是不尊重的表现。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["抽象概念", "可视化", "行为描述"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00006", "b00007", "b00008"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "可视化是详细界限的一部分", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "抽象概念需转化为可视化行为，是界限要详细、可视、可量化的一部分。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "界限后果必须可执行且可持续", "content": "界限的后果必须是父母做得到且能持续做到的。如果后果做不到，就不要说，否则孩子会认为父母说话不算数，反而鼓励打破界限；如果做不到就换一个后果。持续做到要求不只是鼓足勇气用尽力气做一次，而是第二次也能做到。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["后果", "可执行性", "持续性"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012", "b00013", "b00014", "b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a007", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "后果不可执行", "reason": "“界限后果必须可执行且可持续”要求后果必须可执行，而“不可执行的后果示例”列出父母做不到的后果，与原则相反，构成反例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 kind example_of 改为 contrasts"}, {"target": "legacy:jx-a-03", "kind": "complements", "condition": "旧原子强调后果必须执行；候选补充执行且要可持续，不只做到一次；共同适用设定所有界限后果。", "reason": "补充‘可持续’维度，防止只做一次。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-19", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：设定后果时；均要求后果可执行且可持续。", "reason": "补充后果必须做得到且持续做到。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-r-11", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：立界限时设定后果；区别：候选强调可持续做到，legacy 只要求做得到。", "reason": "对应五点中“后果做得到”的要点。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:qx-ca-14", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "均适用于父母立界限后需要维持后果可信度的场景；候选补充了可持续性要求，但核心原则相同。", "reason": "候选强调后果必须做得到且可持续，否则孩子认为父母说话不算数，与旧原子所述空威胁的后果一致。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "不可执行的后果示例", "content": "例如“否则我就要赶你出门”“否则就不让你去学什么”“否则再也不让你跟表弟见面”“如果你偷偷吃糖，我永远不给你买糖”等后果，父母往往做不到，不应使用。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["后果", "不可执行", "反例"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a006", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "与可执行后果原则相反", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“不可执行的后果示例”直接与“界限后果必须可执行且可持续”的原则相反。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "purpose", "title": "后果的目的是帮助而非恐吓", "content": "立界限给后果的目的不是恐吓或威胁孩子，而是帮助孩子理解、赋能给孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["后果", "目的", "赋能"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "可执行后果服务于帮助孩子的目的", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“后果的目的是帮助而非恐吓”支持“界限后果必须可执行且可持续”的要求，因为只有可执行的后果才能真正帮助孩子而非沦为威胁。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0008"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "及时认可孩子遵守界限", "content": "当孩子遵守界限时，父母要第一时间予以认可，表达感激、欣赏、认可、骄傲和自豪，并让孩子知道父母看到他遵守时内心的喜悦。例如，孩子按时放下手机，父母可以说“妈妈好感动，你真是一个诚信的人”。孩子遵守界限是对父母的孝敬和荣耀，父母应有感激之心，经常告诉孩子感谢他愿意尊重和遵守界限。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["认可", "赞赏", "及时反馈"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00016", "b00017", "b00018", "b00019", "b00020"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a010", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "", "reason": "“及时认可孩子遵守界限”强调第一时间表达认可，与“父母不表达赞赏的问题”形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0009"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "父母不表达赞赏的问题", "content": "很多父母看到孩子遵守界限心里高兴但不表达，或者只会说“太棒啦”或干脆不讲话，这不利于孩子感受到父母的喜悦。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["赞赏", "表达", "问题"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a009", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "与及时认可的做法相反", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“父母不表达赞赏的问题”是“及时认可孩子遵守界限”的反面做法。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0010"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "将界限写成合同", "content": "立界限时，与孩子一起讨论并写成合同，孩子可以讨价还价，但一旦确定就白纸黑字写下来，让孩子签字。合同写好后，让孩子读一遍并确认是否理解（适用于大一点的孩子），可逐条确认。合同能避免日后忘记或争执，孩子参与制定更愿意遵守。", "steps": ["与孩子一起讨论界限内容", "允许孩子讨价还价", "确定后写成书面合同", "让孩子签字", "让孩子读一遍并确认理解（适用于大一点的孩子）", "逐条与孩子确认理解"], "conditions": ["适用于大一点的孩子"], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["合同", "书面", "参与", "签字"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00021", "b00022", "b00023", "b00024", "b00025", "b00026", "b00027", "b00028", "b00029", "b00030", "b00031"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a012", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "reason": "“将界限写成合同”中明确包含“合同能避免日后忘记或争执”的效果，支持“书面合同可以避免日后因记忆模糊而争执”这一命题。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "", "reason": "“将界限写成合同”中提出“孩子参与制定更愿意遵守”，直接支持“孩子自己参与制定并签字的界限，他更有主人感，更愿意遵守”这一命题。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a014", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“合同内容要具体明确”不是“将界限写成合同”流程中的明确步骤，而是合同内容的要求；两者都涉及书面合同，但不宜作为 step_of，故改为 association。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 step_of 不成立，改为 association。"}, {"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a015", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "reason": "“合同中包含弥补机制”是可约定的合同条款，不是“将界限写成合同”的固定步骤；两者同属合同制定范畴，改为 association。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 step_of 不成立。"}, {"target": "legacy:jx-c-23", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同条件：9-13岁孩子（或大一点的孩子）", "reason": "候选补充了写成合同、允许讨价还价的具体做法，对应legacy中该年龄段的要点。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-19", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用条件：将界限书面化时；均要求写成合同让孩子签字。", "reason": "补充合同步骤：讨论、讨价还价、写下来签字，适用于大一点的孩子。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "benefit", "title": "合同避免忘记和争执", "content": "书面合同可以避免日后因记忆模糊而争执。例如，父母可能说“你做作业时看手机，我就收你的手机”，孩子却记成“我看手机，你就把手机放到餐厅”，写下来白纸黑字可以防止这类说不清。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["合同", "避免争执", "记忆"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a011", "kind": "supports", "condition": "作为合同方法的一个好处", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“书面合同可以避免日后因记忆模糊而争执”是“将界限写成合同”的一个好处，支持采用该方法。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "benefit", "title": "孩子参与制定界限更愿意遵守", "content": "孩子自己参与制定并签字的界限，他更有主人感，更愿意遵守。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["参与", "主人感", "遵守"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00023", "b00031"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a011", "kind": "supports", "condition": "作为合同方法的一个好处", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“孩子自己参与制定并签字的界限更愿意遵守”是“将界限写成合同”的一个好处，支持采用该方法。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "合同内容要具体明确", "content": "合同中要写清楚什么行为属于不尊重（如吵架时摔门、骂脏话、推人），什么行为属于尊重（如吵架时告诉父母需要安静，获得同意再进房间）。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["合同", "具体行为", "尊重定义"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00025", "b00026", "b00027", "b00028"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "合同内容需要具体化", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“合同中要写清楚具体尊重和不尊重行为”例示并支持“界限必须详细、可视、可量化”的原则。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "合同中包含弥补机制", "content": "合同可以约定弥补机制：如果孩子在双方约定的时间内（如8小时、4小时或2小时，时间可自行商定）主动道歉，后果较轻；如果超时未道歉，后果较重。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["弥补", "道歉", "后果分级"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-23407689b3ba", "blocks": ["b00029", "b00030"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-23407689b3ba-c001:a011", "kind": "association", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“合同可以约定弥补机制”是合同的一个可能组成部分，并非支持“将界限写成合同”这一方法；两者相关但不构成支持，改为 association。", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 supports 方向/类型不当。"}, {"target": "legacy:jx-r-05", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：涉及儿童或可约定的关系时引入弥补机制。区别：候选具体为合同中的弥补机制（道歉时间影响后果），旧原子未限定对象。", "reason": "补充了可操作化的弥补机制设计，用于儿童场景。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-23407689b3ba-c001:u0015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
